<title>JAPAN: Toyota - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toyota - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.08 trln	 vs	    3.73 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  205.50		vs	   27.92</p>
<p> Current	    258.50		vs	   68.06</p>
<p> Net		  131.50		vs	   30.76</p>
<p> EPS		   34.92 yen	  vs	    8.22 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   3.78 billion	  vs	3.74 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p> -Special div	 3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toyota Motor Corp is a leading car manufacturer.</p>
</text>
